      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. To get more granular for the client, can you expand on the specific physical and interpersonal cues that signal this \"commanding authority\"? I'm thinking about things like vocal tone, body language, and even the general \"vibe\" or aesthetic they should project during board meetings to ensure they aren't questioned. What does that look like in practice?",
